{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0473_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "0d15c14a1a94f431111a0b97e977b483831e49aa3c5d8f5dfc3eab855b9d0d1d", "ja": "はい。いつもは出番の直前まで色々考えたりするんです\nけど……今回はそれがあまりなかったんです。", "zh": "是的。平时我总会在上场前一直考虑各种事情，\n但这次却没怎么想这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0473_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "ddd4d14b6addb524c8c2cbefad24d5ae178a4f321ed5a459069bd877760bce4c", "ja": "ステージを楽しもうって気持ちが強くて。もしかしたら\nみんなでバンドをやった影響かもしれませんね。", "zh": "我很想享受舞台。所以，也许是因为之前和大家一起组乐队的影响吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0473_1007_p", "source_sha256": "69a7c5e4cb700ce1396d234b26529127fc0cdaf53137fbe5a053a7643b36f867", "ja": "バンド？　……あっ。\n翼や恵美とガールズバンドのMVを撮った時だな。", "zh": "乐队？……啊。\n是和翼、惠美一起拍女子乐队MV的时候吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0473_1008_p", "source_sha256": "060fee5f332192849fd774778432aa524af7a458e863f859fb96bab50578bdb0", "ja": "あの時の静香は、楽しそうに演奏してたよな。\nリラックスしたいい顔で……。", "zh": "那时候的静香，演奏得很开心呢。\n表情放松，看起来很不错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0473_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "52f5614bf79578dd15f81298e51692ee8e3adfcf7f2f463b847305ebf194ebce", "ja": "{$P$}。それって、\nいつも顔が強張ってるってことですか？", "zh": "{$P$}。你的意思是，我平时总是表情僵硬吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0473_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1962c80f1e819560ba8b0a33df4a1ac0a1063ecef06acba88288c4783e98153c", "ja": "い、いや、そうじゃなくて。\nとてもいい表情をしてたって意味で……。", "zh": "不、不是，我不是那个意思。\n我是说你的表情真的很棒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0473_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "2389e4a9cb5966af8ed41b27b3860984643e1e9c435eaa3e57451765c120ffc1", "ja": "……まあ、褒め言葉として受け取っておきます。\n楽しかったのは事実ですし。", "zh": "……算了，我就当作是在夸我收下吧。\n玩得很开心也是事实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0473_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "46ef1fc048e0d520bee28c39e9e627c647e77fc1a67ad0b1aaf76470a7409bad", "ja": "最近……以前よりも少しだけ、\n気持ちに余裕が出来たって思うんです。", "zh": "最近……我觉得，比起以前，\n心里稍微多了一点从容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0473_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "6437cd498944c8556095c51efe3391397a3c83bfd8db2a556275c8fe9db7f66c", "ja": "ひとつのことに集中しようとして、逆に大切なことを\n見落としたりとか……そういうことも減りましたから。", "zh": "想要专心做好一件事时，反而忽略了重要的事情……这种情况也变少了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0473_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3eb77b92de5d393587de1e1fb9b006e461b7b10dcdbe31c61efea2d7f529c4c6", "ja": "そうか。静香がたくさん頑張ってきた成果だな。\n様々な経験が、心の余裕に繋がったのかもしれない。", "zh": "这样啊。这是静香一直努力的成果啊。\n各种各样的经历，或许让你的内心变得更加从容了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0473_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "c6efc3fb9ec7431049dd379cdffcacd4c830d0acc67f03c83383c9aa4bd22225", "ja": "そうですね。……でもだからと言って、レッスンに\n手は抜きませんよ、{$P$}。", "zh": "是啊。……不过，这也不代表我会在训练上偷懒，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0473_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "2e03fbb5e09dd1a37c6f80fd9da26c114c8422a7dd89b62a91941281bc9695f4", "ja": "もっと色々なお仕事をこなせるようになりたいんです。\nこの程度の成長、全然満足してませんから。ふふっ。", "zh": "我想变得能够完成更多不同类型的工作。\n因为这点程度的成长，完全无法让我满足。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0473_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4206528e98a7c73d599525d38b18988300485b33ad68926b7e6403c63e32d642", "ja": "（静香には、たくさん『アイドル』を楽しんでほしい。\nきっとそれが、一番の成長の秘訣だと思うから……）", "zh": "（希望静香能尽情享受『偶像』。因为我想，那一定是让她获得最大成长的秘诀……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
